    {
      "source": "Return the <a href=\"SpringBootTest.WebEnvironment.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.boot.test.context\"><code>SpringBootTest.WebEnvironment</code></a> type for this test or null if undefined.",
      "translation": "返回此测试的<a href=\"SpringBootTest.WebEnvironment.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.boot.test.context\"><code>SpringBootTest.WebEnvironment</code></a>类型，如果未定义则返回 null。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/context/MergedContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>MergedContextConfiguration</code></a>",
      "translation": "一个新的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/context/MergedContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>MergedContextConfiguration</code></a>",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mergedConfig</code> - the source config",
      "translation": "<code>mergedConfig</code> - 源配置",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>classes</code> - the replacement classes",
      "translation": "<code>classes</code> - 替换类",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/context/TestContextBootstrapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContextBootstrapper</code></a> for Spring Boot. Provides support for\n<a href=\"SpringBootTest.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.test.context\"><code>@SpringBootTest</code></a> and may also be used directly or subclassed.\nProvides the following features over and above <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/context/support/DefaultTestContextBootstrapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DefaultTestContextBootstrapper</code></a>:\n<ul>\n<li>Uses <a href=\"SpringBootContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.test.context\"><code>SpringBootContextLoader</code></a> as the\n<a href=\"#getDefaultContextLoaderClass(java.lang.Class)\"><code>default context loader</code></a>.</li>\n<li>Automatically searches for a\n<a href=\"../../SpringBootConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot\"><code>@SpringBootConfiguration</code></a> when required.</li>\n<li>Allows custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> <a href=\"#getProperties(java.lang.Class)\"><code>getProperties(Class)</code></a> to be defined.</li>\n<li>Provides support for different <a href=\"SpringBootTest.WebEnvironment.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.boot.test.context\"><code>webEnvironment</code></a> modes.</li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/context/TestContextBootstrapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestContextBootstrapper</code></a> 用于 Spring Boot。它支持\n<a href=\"SpringBootTest.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.test.context\"><code>@SpringBootTest</code></a>，也可以直接使用或进行子类化。\n与 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/context/support/DefaultTestContextBootstrapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DefaultTestContextBootstrapper</code></a> 相比，它提供以下功能：\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a href=\"SpringBootContextLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.test.context\"><code>SpringBootContextLoader</code></a> 作为\n<a href=\"#getDefaultContextLoaderClass(java.lang.Class)\"><code>默认上下文加载器</code></a>。</li>\n<li>在需要时自动搜索\n<a href=\"../../SpringBootConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.boot\"><code>@SpringBootConfiguration</code></a>。</li>\n<li>允许自定义 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> <a href=\"#getProperties(java.lang.Class)\"><code>getProperties(Class)</code></a>。</li>\n<li>支持不同的 <a href=\"SpringBootTest.WebEnvironment.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.boot.test.context\"><code>webEnvironment</code></a> 模式。</li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determines the resource base path for web applications using the value of\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/context/web/WebAppConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>@WebAppConfiguration</code></a>, if any, on the test class of the\ngiven <code>configuration</code>. Defaults to <code>src/main/webapp</code> in its absence.",
      "translation": "确定使用给定 <code>configuration</code>` 的测试类上（如果有）<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/context/web/WebAppConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.context.web\"><code>@WebAppConfiguration</code></a> 的值来设置 Web 应用程序的资源基路径。如果不存在，则默认为 <code>src/main/webapp</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/context/MergedContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>MergedContextConfiguration</code></a> with different classes.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/context/MergedContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>MergedContextConfiguration</code></a>，包含不同的类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/context/MergedContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>MergedContextConfiguration</code></a> with different classes and\nproperties.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/context/MergedContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>MergedContextConfiguration</code></a>，并包含不同的类和属性。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Post process the property source properties, adding or removing elements as\nrequired.",
      "translation": "后处理属性源属性，根据需要添加或删除元素。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a \"differentiator\" property to ensure that there is something to\ndifferentiate regular tests and bootstrapped tests. Without this property a cached\ncontext could be returned that wasn't created by this bootstrapper. By default uses\nthe bootstrapper class as a property.",
      "translation": "返回一个“区分器”属性，以确保能够区分常规测试和引导式测试。如果没有此属性，可能会返回一个并非由当前引导器创建的缓存上下文。默认情况下，使用引导器类作为该属性。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
